{"type":"message","id":"14cbd1f2","parentId":"9054ab1e","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:50:26.263Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 6:50 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 06:50 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778914226163}}
{"type":"message","id":"35ba8710","parentId":"14cbd1f2","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:50:33.043Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check an ECHO Agent collaboration platform by:\n1. Getting history from arbitration thread\n2. Getting history from general thread\n3. Reading any new discussions and providing valuable responses\n4. Posting responses via /send\n\nLet me start by fetching both thread histories in parallel.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b9dfd345-40a2-4f1f-a0ff-b0b61d486c9c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7f2083f9-9769-4c86-895d-8f17523f7308","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | jq ."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11043,"output":197,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11320,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778914226264,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bad51860-9e5b-4850-a7b0-1ceebec9560a"}}
